pt;\">성적우수 대학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; font-size: 12pt;\">담당교사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; font-size: 12pt;\">특기장학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; font-size: 12pt;\">모범장학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 28.8px; text-indent: 3.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">장학금 지원 신청자&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">신청학생 본인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 28.8px; text-indent: 3.3pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold;\">신청방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold;\">재단홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">(www.ssef.or.kr)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold;\">에서 본인 인증 후 온라인 신청 및 신청서&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold;\">작성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold;\">출력하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold;\">증빙서류와 함께&nbsp;</span><u style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">방문 또는 등기우편</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -127.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold;\">제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 28.8px; text-indent: 3.3pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -142.8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -142.8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -142.8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold;\">신청기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -142.8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;</span><u style=\"text-indent: -142.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2022. 10. 4.(</span></u><u style=\"text-indent: -142.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">화</span></u><u style=\"text-indent: -142.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 수성바탕체; letter